                   (WS-B38-PRINCIPAL * (WS-B38-MONTHLY-RATE * WS-INTERMEDIATE-VAL2)) / WS-INTERMEDIATE-VAL3
                   ON SIZE ERROR
                       MOVE 9999 TO WS-RETURN-CODE
                       MOVE "INSTALLMENT OVERFLOW ERROR" TO WS-ERROR-MESSAGE
               END-COMPUTE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-B38-INSTALLMENT
           END-IF.
