           MOVE 3.0 TO WS-DIVISOR.
           IF WS-DIVISOR NOT = 0
               COMPUTE WS-ROUNDED-RESULT ROUNDED = WS-INTERMEDIATE-VAL1 / WS-DIVISOR
                   ON SIZE ERROR
